ges/config-resolver/issues/2132\">#2132</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a href=\"https://github.com/smithy-lang/smithy-typescript/commits/@smithy/config-resolver@4.6.16/packages/config-resolver\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Maintainer changes</summary>\n<p>This version was pushed to npm by <a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/~GitHub%20Actions\">GitHub Actions</a>, a new releaser for <code>@​smithy/config-resolver</code> since your current version.</p>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `form-data` from 2.5.5 to 2.5.6\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/form-data/form-data/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md\">form-data's changelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/form-data/form-data/compare/v2.5.5...v2.5.6\">v2.5.6</a> - 2026-06-12</h2>\n<h3>Commits</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>[Fix] escape CR, LF, and <code>&quot;</code> in field names and filenames <a href=\"https://github.com/form-data/form-data/commit/b62031603c2d7c329b2a369b49466790f0ba6314\"><code>b620316</code></a></li>\n<li>[Dev Deps] update <code>@ljharb/eslint-config</code>, <code>auto-changelog</code>, <code>eslint</code>, <code>tape</code> <a href=\"https://github.com/form-data/form-data/commit/12be578e936fd77eee75e2e656955f5343c4b80f\"><code>12be578</code></a></li>\n<li>[Dev Deps] update <code>js-randomness-predictor</code> <a href=\"https://github.com/form-data/form-data/commit/46cfd23bd40be14cfa0391e1c5357c4d74098f23\"><code>46cfd23</code></a></li>\n<li>[Tests] use <code>safe-buffer</code> so the header-injection test runs on node &lt; 4 <a href=\"https://github.com/form-data/form-data/commit/633044a57a7b19f41cec2271ffd24afa2f6280af\"><code>633044a</code></a></li>\n<li>[Deps] update <code>hasown</code> <a href=\"https://github.com/form-data/form-data/commit/e3b96eef1661bca8ea4297de057b78bf2734e900\"><code>e3b96ee</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n